<title>USA: Dravo sees return to earnings track in Q2.</title>
<headline>Dravo sees return to earnings track in Q2.</headline>
<dateline>PITTSBURGH 1997-04-24</dateline>
<text>
<p>Dravo Corp said Thursday it expects to return to its earnings improvement track in the second quarter 1997.</p>
<p>The company said utility lime demand is likely to improve and it expects major non-utility market segments to remain strong.</p>
<p>Second quarter earnings remain vunerable to flooding conidtions in Kentucky, it said.</p>
</text>
